meeting of the holders of the Globalstar common stock.", "location": "S-4, Comparison of Rights of Stockholders of Amazon and Globalstar, page 131", "relevance_score": 4}], "closing_conditions": [{"quote": "The respective obligations of each party to effect the mergers are subject to the satisfaction (or waiver by Globalstar and Amazon) of the following conditions:
