•	closing of the acquisition of MPSI.", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Closing Conditions", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status": [{"quote": "An additional 12 properties are subject to separate merger agreements that are cross-conditioned on a threshold number of mergers closing and remain subject to additional closing conditions, including member approval and lender consent.", "location": "cwmandelmergerinvestorpr.htm | Merger Announcement", "relevance_score": 5}], "security_description": [{"quote": "At the effective time of the applicable Merger, each member's membership interests in the applicable Owner Entity will be converted into the right to receive CROP Units, cash, or a combination thereof", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Merger Consideration", "relevance_score": 5}], "effective_date": [], "available_options": [{"quote": "At the effective time of the applicable Merger, each member's membership interests in the applicable Owner Entity will be converted into the right to receive CROP Units, cash, or a combination thereof, as elected by each member, subject to the proration procedures described below (the “Merger Consideration”).", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Merger Consideration", "relevance_score": 5}], "default_option": [], "election_deadline": [{"quote": "Each member may elect to receive cash and/or CROP Units by delivering a completed election form and accredited investor questionnaire prior to the election deadline.", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Election and Proration", "relevance_score": 5}], "merger_subsidiary": [], "cash_consideration_qualifications": [{"quote": "The aggregate Merger Consideration payable to the members of each Owner Entity is equal to the purchase price specified in the applicable Merger Agreement, subject to adjustment based on estimated and final net closing date assets. The Manager of each Owner Entity will serve as paying agent and will deduct the Owner Entity’s transaction expenses from the Merger Consideration before distribution to the members.", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Merger Consideration", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "With respect to each Owner Entity, the aggregate cash consideration paid to all members in the Owner Entity (other than Mandel and his affiliates) may not exceed 50% (or such other percentage as CROP and the manager of the Owner Entity may agree) of the total Merger Consideration for the acquisition of the Owner Entity. If aggregate cash elections exceed this cap, cash elections will be reduced pro rata and the reduced portion will be substituted with CROP Units. On the other hand, the aggregate cash consideration paid to Mandel and his affiliates (and certain co-investors) across all of the Owner Entities may not exceed 50% of the aggregate Merger Consideration due to such members (both individually and in the aggregate).", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Election and Proration", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "A combination of cash and CROP Units totaling 1.5% of the Merger Consideration (the “Escrow Amount”) will secure certain post-closing adjustments and seller indemnification obligations.", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements | Escrow", "relevance_score": 5}], "stock_exchange_ratio_type": [], "stock_exchange_ratio_qualifications": [], "other_consideration": [], "expected_closing": [{"quote": "Sept 2, 2026 Est. Oct to Dec 2026 Est. Q4 2026 Definitive Agreements Signed SEC 8-K Filing Asset-Level Member Consents & Lender Approvals Transaction Closing(s) Sept 4, 2026", "location": "cwmandelmergerinvestorpr.htm | Summary | Estimated Timeline", "relevance_score": 3}, {"quote": "The merger transactions for twelve properties are expected to be completed in the coming months, subject to lender approvals, approval of the mergers by the members of the property-owning entities, as well as other closing conditions.", "location": "mandelcottonwoodpressrelea.htm | EX-99.1", "relevance_score": 3}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "On September 2, 2026, Cottonwood Communities, Inc. (“CCI”), Cottonwood Residential O.P., LP, a subsidiary and the operating partnership of CCI (“CROP”), and a wholly owned subsidiary of CROP (each, a “Merger Sub” and, together with CCI and CROP, the “CCI Parties”), entered into a series of related merger agreements with entities controlled and managed, directly and indirectly, by Barry R. Mandel (“Mandel”) and his affiliates (each, an “Owner Entity” and, collectively, the “Owner Entities”).", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Item 1.01 Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement | Overview", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "An additional 12 properties are subject to separate merger agreements that are cross-conditioned on a threshold number of mergers closing and remain subject to additional closing conditions, including member approval and lender consent.", "location": "cwmandelmergerinvestorpr.htm | Merger Announcement", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_name": [{"quote": "Each Owner Entity has entered into a separate Agreement and Plan of Merger with CCI, CROP and a Merger Sub (collectively, the “Merger Agreements” and each, a “Merger Agreement”)", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Merger Agreements", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_date": [{"quote": "On September 2, 2026, Cottonwood Communities, Inc. (“CCI”), Cottonwood Residential O.P., LP, a subsidiary and the operating partnership of CCI (“CROP”), and a wholly owned subsidiary of CROP (each, a “Merger Sub” and, together with CCI and CROP, the “CCI Parties”), entered into a series of related merger agreements with entities controlled and managed, directly and indirectly, by Barry R. Mandel (“Mandel”) and his affiliates (each, an “Owner Entity” and, collectively, the “Owner Entities”).", "location": "cci-20260902.htm | Item 1.01 Entry into a Material Definitive Agreement | Overview", "relevance_scor