": "sgis-4.htm | SUMMARY—The Merger Consideration", "relevance_score": 5}], "cash_consideration": [{"quote": "Other than cash in lieu of fractional shares, Leggett & Platt shareholders will not receive cash consideration in the Merger in exchange for their shares of Leggett & Platt stock with which to pay any potential tax liability.", "location": "sgis-4.htm | SUMMARY—Material U.S. Federal Income Tax Consequences", "relevance_score": 5}], "stock_exchange_ratio": [{"quote": "each share of Leggett & Platt common stock issued and outstanding immediately prior to the Effective Time (other than Leggett & Platt Cancelled Shares and Dissenting Shares) will be converted, without any action on the part of the holder thereof, into the right to receive 0.1455 shares of Somnigroup common stock.", "location": "sgis-4.htm | SUMMARY—The Merger Consideration", "relevance_score": 5}], "shareholder_vote_date": [{"quote": "The Leggett & Platt Special Meeting will be held in a virtual meeting format, via a live webcast on , 2026 at 10:00 a.m. Central Time (unless it is adjourned or postponed to a later date).", "location": "sgis-4.htm | THE LEGGETT & PLATT SPECIAL MEETING—Date, Time, Place and Purpose of the Leggett & Platt Special Meeting", "relevance_score": 5}], "closing_conditions": [{"quote": "The respective obligations of each party to consummate the Merger are subject to the satisfaction (or waiver, if permissible under applicable law) at or prior to the Effective Time of each of the following conditions:
