n and a direct, wholly owned subsidiary of Somnigroup", "location": "sgis-4.htm | PROXY STATEMENT/PROSPECTUS", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_date": [{"quote": "Somnigroup, Merger Sub and Leggett & Platt have entered into an Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated as of April 13, 2026.", "location": "sgis-4.htm | SUMMARY—The Merger Agreement", "relevance_score": 5}], "original_filing_date": [], "related_entities": [{"quote": "Sparrow Unity Corporation is a Missouri corporation and a direct, wholly owned subsidiary of Somnigroup. Upon completion of the Merger, Merger Sub will cease to exist. Merger Sub was incorporated on April 9, 2026 for the sole purpose of effecting the Merger.", "location": "sgis-4.htm | THE COMPANIES—Sparrow Unity Corporation (Merger Sub)", "relevance_score": 5}], "security_identifiers": [{"quote": "Somnigroup common stock is listed on the New York Stock Exchange (the “NYSE”) under the trading symbol “SGI,” and Leggett & Platt common stock is listed on the NYSE under the trading symbol “LEG.”", "location": "sgis-4.htm | PROXY STATEMENT/PROSPECTUS", "relevance_score": 5}]}

