o the Exchange Ratio.", "location": "Annex B — Opinion of Roth Capital Partners, LLC, page B-1", "relevance_score": 5}], "other_consideration": [], "expected_closing": [{"quote": "The parties expect to consummate the Mergers no later than the third calendar quarter of 2026, subject to the satisfaction or waiver of the conditions precedent to such closing.", "location": "THE MERGER AGREEMENT — Overview, page 84", "relevance_score": 5}], "event_status_details": [{"quote": "On March 4, 2026, Texas Mineral Resources Corp., a Delaware corporation (“TMRC”) entered into a definitive Agreement and Plan of Merger (the “Merger Agreement”) by and among USA Rare Earth, Inc. (“USAR”), TMRC, Hamer Merger Sub, Inc., a Delaware corporation and a wholly owned subsidiary of USAR (“First Merger Sub”) and Hamer Merger Sub, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company and a wholly owned subsidiary of USAR (“Second Merger Sub” and together with First Merger Sub, the “Merger Subs”).", "location": "TRANSACTION PROPOSED-YOUR VOTE IS VERY IMPORTANT", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The special meeting of TMRC stockholders will be held virtually via live webcast at www.virtualshareholdermeeting.com/TMRX2026SM, on Tuesday, July 28, 2026 at 10:00 a.m. Eastern Time.", "location": "THE TMRC SPECIAL MEETING — Date, Time and Place, page 52", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_name": [{"quote": "entered into a definitive Agreement and Plan of Merger (the “Merger Agreement”)", "location": "TRANSACTION PROPOSED-YOUR VOTE IS VERY IMPORTANT", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_date": [{"quote": "“Merger Agreement” means the Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated March 4, 2026, by and among USAR, TMRC, First Merger Sub and Second Merger Sub, as it may be amended from time to time.", "location": "GLOSSARY OF TERMS", "relevance_score": 5}], "original_filing_date": [], "related_entities": [{"quote": "Hamer Merger Sub, Inc., a Delaware corporation and a wholly owned subsidiary of USAR (“First Merger Sub”) and Ha