 Business Combination Agreement", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "The closing of the proposed business combination is subject to, among other things, the approval by shareholders of RAAQ and IQM of the business combination agreement and the satisfaction of other customary closing conditions.", "location": "EX-99.1, Press Release, Transaction Highlights", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_name": [{"quote": "entered into a business combination agreement (the “Business Combination Agreement”).", "location": "FORM 8-K, Item 1.01, Business Combination Agreement", "relevance_score": 5}], "agreement_date": [{"quote": "BUSINESS COMBINATION AGREEMENT, dated as of February 22, 2026", "location": "EX-2.1, Business Combination Agreement", "relevance_score": 5}], "original_filing_date": [], "related_entities": [{"quote": "IQM US LLC, a Delaware limited liability company and an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of IQM (“Merger Sub”), and Eclipse QC S.à r.l., a Luxembourg private limited liability company (société à responsabilité limitée) and a direct wholly owned subsidiary of IQM (“LuxCo,” collectively with Merger Sub, the “Merger Subs”)", "location": "FORM 8-K, Item 1.01, Business Combination Agreement", "relevance_score": 5}], "security_identifiers": []}

