ation Agreement — Securitize Common Stock, page 99", "relevance_score": 5}], "shareholder_vote_date": [{"quote": "concurrently with the execution and delivery of this Agreement and in connection with the Transactions, and as an inducement to SPAC’s willingness to enter into this Agreement, certain Company Stockholders have entered into the Company Stockholder Support Agreement with SPAC, PubCo, and the Company substantially in the form attached as Exhibit A(ii) (the “Company Stockholder Support Agreement”), pursuant to which, among other things, each such Company Stockholder executing the Company Stockholder Support Agreement agrees to (a) subject to certain exceptions, not transfer Company Stock, (b) vote their Company Stock (to the extent such Company Stock has voting rights) in favor of the adoption and approval of this Agreement, the Ancillary Documents to which the Company or any other Company Entity is a party and the Transactions (including by execution and delivery of the Company Written Consent on the date of this Agreement), the Company Merger and the other Transactions;", "location": "S-4/A, Annex A — Business Combination Agreement, Recitals, page A-2", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "This Business Combination Agreement (this “Agreement”) is made and entered into as of October 27, 2025", "location": "S-4/A, Annex A — Business Combination Agreement, page A-1", "relevance_score": 5}, {"quote": "Concurrently with the execution of this Agreement, the Company shall have delivered to SPAC the duly-executed Company Written Consent.", "location": "S-4/A, Annex A — Business Combination Agreement, Section 7.14(h), page A-74", "relevance_score": 5}], "closing_conditions": [{"quote": "The obligations of the Parties to consummate (or cause to be consummated) the Transactions are subject to the following mutual conditions, which may not be waived:
